OL,3,GNEWSAPub avoids losing licence after
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pub has avoided losing its premises
OL,7,Flicence after bosses accepted tough new
OL,8,Fconditions following a stabbing.
OL,10,FPolice had called for an urgent review
OL,11,Fof the licence at the Boars Head pub in
OL,12,FBlackpool after the incident on 16
OL,13,FJuly, following a live screening of the
OL,14,FWorld Cup match between England and
OL,15,FArgentina.
OL,17,FThe victim was taken to hospital where
OL,18,Fhis condition was described at the time
OL,19,Fas being serious but not
OL,20,Flife-threatening and an arrest was
OL,21,Fmade.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
