OL,3,GNEWSAPub avoids losing licence after
OL,4,Astabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers said the stabbing, which
OL,7,Foccurred outside the Preston Old Road
OL,8,Fpub after a disturbance inside, was not
OL,9,Fan isolated incident and there appeared
OL,10,Fto be an issue with trouble during
OL,11,Ftimes when England matches were
OL,12,Fscreened there.
